We require the projections to be surjective because otherwise the
#local("00GH")[species of cartesian decompositions] would not be
#local("0086")[tame], since the empty set can be written as $emptyset ~= A xx
emptyset$ for any $A: "FinSet"$. This addition ensures that our definition agrees with
the definition in the literature (TODO: place reference).

